     A* ======================================================================
     A* ITEMDSPF - Item maintenance screens
     A* Author: Arnav    Created: 2026-10-06
     A*
     A* Same layout and logic as CUSTDSPF (list subfile, key legend,
     A* detail in four modes, message subfile); only the fields differ.
     A*
     A* Indicator map:
     A*   03 F3=Exit app      05 F5=Add     06 F6=Edit    07 F7=Delete
     A*   10 F10=Save/Confirm 12 F12=Back
     A*   31 SFLDSP  32 SFLDSPCTL  33 SFLCLR  34 SFLEND
     A*   41 protect Item No (all modes except ADD)
     A*   42 protect the other fields (DISPLAY, DELETE)
     A*   51 Item No  52 Description  53 Status  54 Price  55 Stock (errors)
     A*   98 message subfile end marker
     A*
     A* EDTCDE(J): thousands commas, decimal point, '-' after a negative
     A* number, zero shown as .00 / 0. To type a negative value on a 5250
     A* screen: type the digits, then press Field- (field minus).
     A* Description is 50 long - the list shows LDESC (first 30 chars).
     A*
     A* Change log:
     A*   2026-10-07  Arnav  Created (Sprint 3, checkpoint 3B)
     A* ======================================================================
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A                                      CA03(03 'F3=Exit')
     A                                      CA12(12 'F12=Back')
     A*
     A* List row (one per item)
     A          R ITEMSFL                   SFL
     A            SEL            1A  B  6  3
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A            ITEMNO         7Y 0O  6  6EDTCDE(Z)
     A            LDESC         30A  O  6 15
     A            UNITPRICE      9Y 2O  6 47EDTCDE(J)
     A            STOCKQTY       9Y 0O  6 62EDTCDE(J)
     A            STATUS         1A  O  6 79
     A*
     A* List control: heading + the subfile
     A          R ITEMCTL                   SFLCTL(ITEMSFL)
     A                                      SFLSIZ(9999)
     A                                      SFLPAG(0010)
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      CF05(05 'F5=Add')
     A                                      CF06(06 'F6=Edit')
     A                                      CF07(07 'F7=Delete')
     A  31                                  SFLDSP
     A  32                                  SFLDSPCTL
     A  33                                  SFLCLR
     A  34                                  SFLEND(*MORE)
     A                                  1  2'ITEMLIST'
     A                                  1 31'ITEM MAINTENANCE'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 72DATE EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                  2 71USER
     A                                  4  2'Type X, then Enter=Display  -
     A                                      F6=Edit  F7=Delete'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A                                  5  2'Sel'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5  6'Item No'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5 15'Description'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5 50'Unit Price'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5 68'Stock'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5 77'Sts'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A*
     A* Key legend (a control record may not have fields below its
     A* subfile - CPD7812 - so it is a record of its own)
     A          R ITEMKEY                   OVERLAY
     A                                 23  2'F3=Exit  F5=Add  F6=Edit  -
     A                                      F7=Delete  F12=Back'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A*
     A* Detail: one item. MODE and LEGEND are set by ITEMPGM.
     A          R ITEMDTL                   OVERLAY
     A                                      CF10(10 'F10=Save')
     A                                  1  2'ITEMDTL'
     A                                  1 31'ITEM MAINTENANCE'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 64'Mode:'
     A            MODE           8A  O  1 70DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  2 71USER
     A                                  4  3'Item No . . . :'
     A            ITEMNO         7Y 0B  4 20EDTCDE(Z)
     A  41                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  51                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N41                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5  3'Description . :'
     A            ITEMDESC      50A  B  5 20
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  52                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  6  3'Category  . . :'
     A            CATEGORY      20A  B  6 20
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  7  3'Unit Price  . :'
     A            UNITPRICE      9Y 2B  7 20EDTCDE(J)
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  54                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  8  3'Stock Qty . . :'
     A            STOCKQTY       9Y 0B  8 20EDTCDE(J)
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  55                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  9  3'Status  . . . :'
     A            STATUS         1A  B  9 20
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  53                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  9 24'(A=Active, I=Inactive)'
     A            LEGEND        78A  O 23  2COLOR(BLU)
     A*
     A* Message subfile - same as MENUDSPF / CUSTDSPF
     A          R MSGSFL                    SFL
     A                                      SFLMSGRCD(24)
     A            MSGKEY                    SFLMSGKEY
     A            PGMQ                      SFLPGMQ(10)
     A          R MSGCTL                    SFLCTL(MSGSFL)
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      SFLDSP
     A                                      SFLDSPCTL
     A                                      SFLINZ
     A  98                                  SFLEND
     A                                      SFLSIZ(0002)
     A                                      SFLPAG(0001)
     A            PGMQ                      SFLPGMQ(10)
